  RulesText: At the start of the game, if any enemy model in the opposing Fireteam
    makes a Scout move, all friendly models with Counter Intelligence (CI) can make
    a 1 cube Advance action. CI moves are always done after the opposing Fireteam
    has completed all its Scout moves.
